# PROJECT: KS CAFE — Premium, Responsive Café Website

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, brand strategist, conversion copywriter, frontend developer, and local SEO specialist.

Design and develop a complete, polished, client-presentable website for **KS CAFE**, a café business identified through its Google Business Profile.

Google Business Profile:
https://maps.app.goo.gl/ypch6kTP9UQMMmAE6

The goal is to create a visually impressive, modern website that helps potential customers discover the café, explore its verified menu, understand its location, and take action.

This is a real-business website demonstration. Prioritize authenticity, visual quality, accessibility, performance, mobile usability, and practical business value.

Do not build a generic restaurant template. Create a distinctive independent-café experience using the branding, content strategy, and requirements below.

