## 8. FUNCTIONALITY

Every visible control must have a meaningful, working behavior.

### Navigation

- All navigation links must work.
- Mobile navigation must open and close correctly.
- Navigation must support keyboard interaction.
- The current page should be identifiable where appropriate.
- Focus indicators must remain visible.

### Directions

Use the verified Google Maps destination.

If the correct destination cannot be confirmed, keep the URL editable and clearly marked as a placeholder.

### Calling

Use a tel: link for the verified business number.

Hide the calling action if no verified number is available.

### WhatsApp

If a verified WhatsApp number is supplied, implement a working wa.me link with a URL-encoded default enquiry message.

Do not invent a number.

### Menu

- Menu cards should be generated from editable data.
- Category filters should work if implemented.
- Prices must be accurate.
- Missing prices must not be replaced with fabricated values.
- Images should have suitable alt text.

### Gallery

- Images should open in an accessible lightbox when clicked.
- Include a visible close button.
- Support Escape to close.
- Support keyboard navigation where applicable.
- Return focus to the initiating element when the lightbox closes.

### Contact form

If a working contact service is configured, implement:

- Name.
- Contact information.
- Enquiry type.
- Message.
- Appropriate consent information.
- Client-side validation.
