## 13. PERFORMANCE

Prioritize fast loading and a smooth experience on mobile connections.

Requirements:

- Compress images.
- Prefer WebP or AVIF where appropriate.
- Use responsive image sources.
- Lazy-load below-the-fold images.
- Avoid unnecessary JavaScript.
- Minimize third-party dependencies.
- Avoid autoplay video.
- Prevent layout shifts by specifying image dimensions.
- Load fonts efficiently.
- Avoid excessive DOM complexity.

Target good Core Web Vitals:

- LCP: 2.5 seconds or less.
- INP: 200 milliseconds or less.
- CLS: 0.1 or less.

These are performance targets, not guaranteed results.

